### API HTTP Client


### 변수 설정
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### 테스트용 사용자 정보
@testEmail = test@example.com
@testPassword = password123
@testName = 테스트 사용자
@testNickName = testuser
@testPhoneNumber = 010-1234-5678

##########################################
### 인증 API (/api/auth)
##########################################

### 0. 회원가입 (테스트용 사용자 생성)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "{{testName}}",
  "nickName": "{{testNickName}}",
  "email": "{{testEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}",
  "phoneNumber": "{{testPhoneNumber}}"
}

### 0. 로그인 (토큰 자동 저장)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{testEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.data.refreshToken);
    client.log("Access Token: " + response.body.data.accessToken);
    client.log("Refresh Token: " + response.body.data.refreshToken);
%}

##########################################
### 결제 API (/api/payments)
##########################################

### 1. 결제 준비 (주문 항목 기반으로 주문 생성 및 결제 준비)
### 강좌 생성 API를 먼저 실행 후 응답으로 받은 courseId를 Request Body에 넣어주세요!
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/prepare
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "courseId": 101
    }
  ]
}

### 2. 결제 완료
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/confirm
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{

}